WEBVTT

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:13.185
"Transform my reflection,
改变我的形象

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:17.273
cast into perfection,
lashes, lips and complexion.
让我美丽无双
睫毛、嘴唇，还有肤色

00:00:17.356 --> 00:00:20.693
Make me she whom I'd agree
梦想中的人，成为最美丽的人

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:22.736
holds more beauty over me."
梦想中的人，成为最美丽的人

00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:37.418
(thunder stops)

00:01:19.418 --> 00:01:21.128
(jazz band playing "In the Mood")

00:01:24.423 --> 00:01:26.133
(people conversing, laughing)

00:01:29.887 --> 00:01:32.556
Ladies and gentlemen, Miss Pevensie.
女士们先生们

00:01:33.224 --> 00:01:35.601
(applause)

00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:37.019
She's quite a looker.
她简直太美了，像天仙一样
太可爱了

00:01:37.103 --> 00:01:38.687
Swell.
她简直太美了，像天仙一样
太可爱了

00:01:38.771 --> 00:01:40.022
Edmund!
埃德蒙

00:01:40.106 --> 00:01:41.649
You look beautiful, sister.
你真漂亮，苏珊

00:01:41.732 --> 00:01:42.983
As always.
天生的美女

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:44.193
Peter!
彼得

00:01:44.985 --> 00:01:47.029
Excuse me, miss,
can I get a photo?
对不起，小姐，能给你拍照吗？

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:49.115
Mother is going to love this.
妈妈一定喜欢…

00:01:49.198 --> 00:01:51.117
All her children in one picture.
所有孩子的合影

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.451
Smile.
笑一笑

00:01:52.535 --> 00:01:54.245
Hang on, where am I?
等等，我在哪儿，我是说露西在哪儿

00:01:55.246 --> 00:01:56.330
I mean, where's Lucy?
等等，我在哪儿，我是说露西在哪儿

00:01:56.413 --> 00:01:58.916
Lucy? Who's Lucy?
露西？谁是露西？

00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:01.419
Susan, what's wrong?
苏珊，你怎么了？

00:02:01.502 --> 00:02:04.213
Come on now, miss.
Nice, big smile.
注意，小姐，来个迷人的微笑

00:02:04.296 --> 00:02:07.007
Edmund, I'm not sure about all this.
I think I want to go back.
埃德蒙，我有点心神不定，我该回去了

00:02:07.091 --> 00:02:10.010
-Go back where?
-To Narnia.
回纳尼亚

00:02:10.094 --> 00:02:11.512
What on earth is Narnia?
什么是纳尼亚？

00:02:12.096 --> 00:02:14.598
What's going on? Stop this!
这是怎么回事，别照了

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.395
(gasps)

00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:23.232
Lucy.
露西

00:02:24.525 --> 00:02:25.693
Aslan?
阿斯兰

00:02:29.947 --> 00:02:31.574
What have you
done, child?
你做了什么，孩子？

00:02:33.284 --> 00:02:34.493
I don't know.
不知道

00:02:35.536 --> 00:02:36.787
That was awful.
太可怕了

00:02:37.913 --> 00:02:39.582
But you chose it, Lucy.
可那是你的选择，露西

00:02:41.208 --> 00:02:43.043
I didn't mean to choose all of that.
那并不是我真正的选择

00:02:44.336 --> 00:02:46.672
I just wanted to be beautiful like Susan.
我只不过想和苏珊一样漂亮

00:02:48.048 --> 00:02:49.091
That's all.
仅此而已

00:02:50.176 --> 00:02:54.305
You wished yourself away
and with it, much more.
你想变成别人，结果会失去自己

00:02:54.388 --> 00:02:58.476
Your brothers and sister
wouldn't know Narnia without you, Lucy.
若不是你，露西
你的哥哥姐姐不会知道纳尼亚

00:02:59.059 --> 00:03:01.270
You discovered it first, remember?
是你先发现的，对吗？

00:03:04.273 --> 00:03:05.691
I'm so sorry.
对不起

00:03:06.901 --> 00:03:08.486
You doubt your value.
你怀疑自己的价值

00:03:09.737 --> 00:03:11.739
Don't run from who you are.
人可不能失去自我

00:03:13.574 --> 00:03:15.701
-(thunder cracks)
-Aslan!
阿斯兰

00:03:15.785 --> 00:03:17.703
(ship creaking)
阿斯兰

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:29.340
(thunder crashes, rumbles)

00:03:39.308 --> 00:03:41.018
(roaring)

00:03:43.395 --> 00:03:46.774
(eerie voices whispering)

00:04:06.669 --> 00:04:07.795
Father...
父王

00:04:09.422 --> 00:04:11.173
Father... (groans)
父王

00:04:11.257 --> 00:04:14.552
FEMALE VOICE:
Edmund... Edmund...
埃德蒙

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.639
Come with me.
来吧，跟我走

00:04:18.722 --> 00:04:19.849
Join me.
来吧，跟我走

00:04:23.561 --> 00:04:24.812
-LUCY: Edmund.
-(gasps)
埃德蒙

00:04:29.275 --> 00:04:30.526
Oh, Lucy.
露西

00:04:31.944 --> 00:04:33.279
(gasps)

00:04:33.362 --> 00:04:34.864
I can't sleep.
我睡不着

00:04:35.906 --> 00:04:38.451
Let me guess. Bad dreams.
让我猜猜…

00:04:40.536 --> 00:04:42.121
So either we're all going mad...
要么是我们都疯了

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.000
...or something's playing
with our minds.
要么是我们心里有杂念

00:05:08.481 --> 00:05:10.399
I doubt the lords
stopped here, my liege.
我真怀疑上帝是否来过这儿，陛下

00:05:10.483 --> 00:05:12.151
There's no sign of anything living.
这里完全没有生命的迹象

00:05:12.234 --> 00:05:14.361
Right.
Well, once we get ashore,
是的

00:05:14.445 --> 00:05:16.614
take your men and search
for food and water.
上岸后你们去寻找食物和淡水

00:05:16.697 --> 00:05:18.741
The three of us will look for clues.
我们三个去寻找线索

00:05:18.824 --> 00:05:20.451
Hang on, you mean the four of us.
等等，应该是四个

00:05:23.037 --> 00:05:25.372
Come on, please don't
send me back to the rat.
求求你千万别让我留下陪伴老鼠

00:05:25.456 --> 00:05:27.291
I heard that.
我听到了

00:05:28.626 --> 00:05:29.877
(quietly) Big ears.
大耳贼

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.879
I heard that, too.
我又听到了

00:05:31.962 --> 00:05:33.881
(chuckling)
我又听到了

00:05:37.343 --> 00:05:39.345
Go on, unload it all.
带好物品，尽可能寻找食物
来，拿好了

00:05:39.428 --> 00:05:41.347
(distant rumbling)
带好物品，尽可能寻找食物
来，拿好了

00:05:43.516 --> 00:05:45.559
(rumbling continues)

00:05:49.647 --> 00:05:52.233
CASPIAN: Look, we're not
the first ones on this island.
瞧，我们不是第一批上岛的人

00:05:52.316 --> 00:05:53.776
The lords?
勋爵？

00:05:53.859 --> 00:05:55.319
Could be.
可能吧

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.742
What do you think could be down there?
你认为里面会有什么？

00:06:03.369 --> 00:06:04.453
EDMUND: Let's find out.
下去看看

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.463
(rumbling continues)

